cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
title: "inspireauth: INSPIRE-HEP author records for Latin America"
abstract: >-
  The main content of this record is the full dataset data/inspire_LA.json
  (230 MB): a single JSON file with 57,588 records (one per author and
  institution) of 29,979 authors in High Energy Physics, Cosmology and
  Astroparticle Physics with affiliations to Latin American institutions
  in INSPIRE-HEP, covering 49,181 papers up to 2022. Each record has the
  author's identifiers (INSPIRE BAI, ORCID), institution and country,
  INSPIRE profile positions and ranks, thesis advisors, inferred gender
  with its probability, and the list of papers with year, citations,
  arXiv category, journal and the author's affiliation and rank at the
  time of publication. The data schema is documented in README.md. The
  archive also contains the notebooks used to build the dataset and
  auxiliary data. It is the data behind "Statistical Analysis of
  Scientific Metrics in High Energy, Cosmology, and Astroparticle Physics
  in Latin America".
